config TA1618_NANDC_RO_LAB
	bool "Nokia TA-1618 read-only NANDC diagnostic"
	depends on MACH_NOKIA_TA1618 && HAS_DMA && !MTD && !SPI
	help
	  Enable read-only access to the Nokia TA-1618 internal NAND in the
	  nand-ro-lab profile. After checking the NAND identity and feature state,
	  the driver exposes one physical stream containing every page's main and
	  OOB bytes. It provides no MTD, generic SPI, ioctl, mmap, feature-write,
	  program or erase operation.
